---
args: { prepared: PreparedEvidence, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Recover recipient needs from descriptions and prior confirmations without inferring sensitive circumstances. Distinguish necessary features from preferences, record accessibility and timing constraints explicitly supplied by recipients, and preserve consent for contact or delivery.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
